  "readsSource": "docs/reference/view-checklist.md summary table (head c54a10e of CC-01). 'reads.datasets' are package datasets and code constants; 'reads.stores' are v5 user-work localStorage keys. 'dependsOn' lists the other tickets this view depends on for a store it reads, after the contract rules in readsNote; 'reads' keeps every store the view reads. A store's owner is the owner of the view that writes it (storeOwners). These are view-level facts; ticket dependencies in work-items.json follow the coordinator's decisions in .orchestration/reports/PLAN-M2/r2/report.md.",
